flowchart TD
 A[Eligible active state] --> B[Buyer or supplier opens dispute]
 B --> C[Stored resolver notified]
 C --> D{Resolver decision recorded within 5 days?}
 D -->|Yes| E[Resolver records release/refund]
 D -->|No| F[Either party may propose one replacement]
 C --> G[Parties may mutually propose replacement at any time]
 F --> H{Other party approves same new account?}
 G --> H
 H -->|Yes| I[New resolver active; fresh 5-day window]
 I --> C
 H -->|No| J[Dispute remains locked; no admin override]
 E --> K[ReleaseAuthorized or RefundAuthorized]
